<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 1080px; padding: 18px 24px 20px; gap: 14px">

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge)">
    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab">Day</div>
      <div class="tab">Roster</div>
      <div class="tab on">Market</div>
      <div class="tab">School</div>
      <div class="tab">Armoury</div>
      <div class="tab">Province</div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-grow: 1"></div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding-bottom: 7px">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; width: 220px">
        <div class="note" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between">
          <span>Hour of the Horse</span><span style="color: var(--ink)">Day 23 of 60</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meter"><i style="width: 38%"></i></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 6px">
        <div class="btn" style="padding: 5px 11px">II</div>
        <div class="btn off" style="padding: 5px 11px">1&times;</div>
        <div class="btn" style="padding: 5px 11px; color: var(--heading); border-color: var(--heading)">2&times;</div>
        <div class="btn off" style="padding: 5px 11px">4&times;</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 20px">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
      <div style="font-size: 26px">The Market</div>
      <div class="note">Every price is on its own button, and every stall says how long the stock will last.</div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-grow: 1"></div>
    <div class="chip" style="min-width: 132px">
      <div class="fig">412</div><div class="cap">gold</div>
      <div class="trend">&minus;96 if you fill up</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-grow: 1; min-height: 0">

    <!-- the stalls. Buy and sell are the same row shape, unlike the reference. -->
    <div class="panel" style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-width: 0">
      <div class="sec">The stalls</div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px">

        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline">
            <span>Rice</span><span class="note">2 gold each</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fig">96 <span class="note" style="font-size: 13px">in store</span></div>
          <div class="meter" style="height: 6px"><i style="width: 46%; background: var(--pending)"></i></div>
          <div class="note" style="color: var(--pending)">&minus;7 a day &mdash; 13 days left</div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 6px">
            <div class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 8px">Buy 10 &middot; 20g</div>
            <div class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 8px">Sell 10 &middot; 14g</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline">
            <span>Water</span><span class="note">1 gold each</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fig">140 <span class="note" style="font-size: 13px">in store</span></div>
          <div class="meter" style="height: 6px"><i style="width: 70%; background: var(--good)"></i></div>
          <div class="note">&minus;7 a day &mdash; 20 days left</div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 6px">
            <div class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 8px">Buy 10 &middot; 10g</div>
            <div class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 8px">Sell 10 &middot; 7g</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; border-color: #5a2e29">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline">
            <span>Medicine</span><span class="note">12 gold each</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fig" style="color: var(--warning)">3 <span class="note" style="font-size: 13px">in store</span></div>
          <div class="meter" style="height: 6px"><i style="width: 12%; background: var(--warning)"></i></div>
          <div class="note" style="color: var(--warning)">&minus;2 a day &mdash; Genji runs dry in 2</div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 6px">
            <div class="btn primary" style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 8px">Buy 6 &middot; 72g</div>
            <div class="btn off" style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 8px">Sell &mdash; a man needs it</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline">
            <span>Sake</span><span class="note">34 gold a cask</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fig">1 <span class="note" style="font-size: 13px">cask</span></div>
          <div class="meter" style="height: 6px"><i style="width: 25%; background: var(--indigo)"></i></div>
          <div class="note">No daily drain. It sits until you call a feast.</div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 6px">
            <div class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 8px">Buy 1 &middot; 34g</div>
            <div class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 8px">Sell 1 &middot; 22g</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="sec">A feast</div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center">
        <div class="card" style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px">
          <div>Two casks and a night off. Every man's composure climbs, and tomorrow nobody trains.</div>
          <div class="note">Composure +18 across the mat &middot; one day lost &middot; 2 sake, 12 rice</div>
        </div>
        <div class="btn off" style="flex: none">Call a feast &mdash; you have 1 cask of 2</div>
      </div>

      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="sec">What the day will cost either way</div>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px">
        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px">
          <div class="note">Rice and water for four men and two masters</div>
          <div class="fig">7 rice &middot; 7 water</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px">
          <div class="note">The infirmary</div>
          <div class="fig">2 medicine</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px">
          <div class="note">Lord Ii carries Ren's rice</div>
          <div class="fig" style="color: var(--good)">&minus;1 rice saved</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- the market is also the junction: recruits and the pit -->
    <div class="panel" style="width: 470px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
      <div class="sec">Also in the town</div>

      <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline">
          <span>Take a recruit from chat</span><span class="fig">40 gold</span>
        </div>
        <div class="note">214 in the pool &middot; 9 have typed <span style="color: var(--ink)">!no</span></div>
        <div class="note">The name is drawn at random and you may change it before he steps on the mat.</div>
        <div class="btn off">The mat is full &mdash; six of six</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline">
          <span>Hire a master</span><span class="fig">180 gold</span>
        </div>
        <div class="note">A wandering instructor. Training +8% while he stays, and he eats.</div>
        <div class="btn">Hire him</div>
      </div>

      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="sec">The pit behind the rice store</div>
      <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline">
          <span>A blind bout</span><span class="fig" style="color: var(--good)">310 gold</span>
        </div>
        <div class="note">You are not told who he is fighting. Choose the kit knowing nothing.</div>
        <div class="note" style="color: var(--warning)">Lethal, like every fight that leaves the dojo.</div>
        <div class="btn danger">Enter a man</div>
      </div>

      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="sec">Sparring on the mat</div>
      <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px">
        <div>Your own two against each other. No gold, no death &mdash; wounds, gains and a bruised mood.</div>
        <div class="note">The only safe way to try a recruit, or a maimed man's new class.</div>
        <div class="btn">Set a bout</div>
      </div>

      <div style="flex-grow: 1"></div>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="note">
        Prices move with the province. A village you have cleared sells cheaper for a while.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
